        "The dataset contains 7043 customer records and 21 columns. Every column has 7043 non-null values, and there are no fully duplicated rows. The 'TotalCharges' column is stored as a string, so I will convert its values to numeric before examining descriptive statistics for the numerical columns. I will also convert boolean values to strings. 'Churn' will be cast as an integer for ease of EDA and modeling."
